        "code": "CONFOUNDING",
        "text": "Attributing H2-H1 changes solely to a defense's effect is highly susceptible to confounding. Factors like offensive adjustments, score effects, player fatigue, coaching decisions, substitution patterns, and inherent game variance will all influence H2-H1 changes, making it difficult to isolate the defensive contribution. Prior work (FAM:SF-APPA-005) indicated difficulty separating defensive adjustment from offensive execution."
