      "code": "CONFOUNDING",
      "text": "The H2-H1 change in opponent performance can be influenced by numerous factors beyond a specific defensive 'effect', such as offensive adjustments, score effects, game pace, player fatigue, coaching strategy, and inherent variance. Isolating the defensive contribution will be very difficult, making any observed 'effect' prone to confounding."
